<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1714" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀερ-ίζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀήρ</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be like air</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Secund.
				<u>Sent.</u>
				4
			</span></i>; hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>to be thin as air</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.68.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be light blue</i> (or perh. <i>grey, cloudy</i>), of
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολύβδαινα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				5.85
			</span></i>; of cataract, Dem. Ophth. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				7.53
			</span></i>; of a kind of jasper, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				37.115
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Leid.V.</u>
				6.28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>'tread on air'</i>, of boxers, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Gym.</u>
				50
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
